# NEVER PUBLISH ANY OF THIS.
#
# This working tree also holds the game itself, the research material and the
# tools that produced it. None of it is ours to distribute, and a single
# `git add -A` in the wrong directory would ship several hundred megabytes of
# somebody else's copyright. The public repository is built by
# tools/bin/publish.sh, which copies an allow-list rather than excluding a
# deny-list - this file is the second line of defence, not the first.
dos/
pc/
ref/
re/
GTA*/
docs/
*.iso
*.mp4
*.gry
*.cmp
*.til
*.raw

